normalized.text:
{
  "summary": "The RNA-only, multiprofile scGPT model with avgpool achieved validation accuracy 0.5305 and F1 0.5152, below the otherwise matched scVI_n200 avgpool result of 0.6501 and also below multiprofile PCA avgpool at 0.5907. This suggests that, in this specific configuration, scGPT did not match the stronger scVI_n200 RNA representation, though this is a single comparative observation rather than a general encoder ranking. It remains uncertain whether the gap reflects scGPT representation quality, training or initialization variability, or other uncontrolled factors."
}

